    "description": "The College of Physician and Surgeons Pakistan (CPSP), as a WHO Collaborating Centre for Training in Research and Educational Development of Health Personnel, has recently appointed faculty from AKU's Department of Pathology and Microbiology, to constitute a number of committees for various Pathology specialties. Faculty appointments are as follows:",
